# __FIA_DISPLAY_NAME__

This project was created with FIA Framework.

```bash
bun run dev
bun run build
bun run run
```

If the project was created with `--no-install`, run `bun install` first.

`bun run dev` launches the native FIA window with React hot reload. The other commands create a
signed local application or launch the current source through the production runtime protocol.

## Runtime boundary

The server entry exports `defineApp({ routes, websocket })`. FIA owns the loopback listener,
bootstrap session, Host protocol, and process lifecycle; application code owns its route behavior.
